w&oe=69DCFDD0"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1752140042431050", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_1752140049097716_5207635900878794220_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kBdv6xGNT5wQ7kNvwHJPiNW&_nc_oc=AdpudWYKEX73SC9utXo1D4FpYIvORyt5PeRHXy59PKQQ7DxY5XlW804vnURP4RykecQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1dP2MkmkdISxkZ7jnWD3NHUQDcdRvXZi579NPod_-fug&oe=69DCDE5C"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2026868694872560", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_2026868698205893_7773513040006310927_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TXs8YS-hmQIQ7kNvwFHGxFG&_nc_oc=Adp7CtW7lmDXEY0Rap8qjoknApEbwP737LUXFMLSBMHucCcGq7k26V9E9Oq0EKSrKOA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3HlseRhToM0v7fmVTwOUgrDdCBNdcKW4urpAddmQ97ow&oe=69DCEE1A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Panda Cooking Master", "keywords": ["slicing", "cooking", "panda", "restaurant", "ninja"], "long_description": "**You are a panda running the most chaotic ramen shop in all of Asia. \ud83c\udf5c**\n\nIngredients fly through the air, customers are hungry, and your blade is the only thing standing between a perfect bowl of tonkotsu and an absolute disaster.\n\n**Slice the right ingredients mid-air to cook the perfect recipe! \ud83d\udd2a**\n\n{1367339365435340}\n\n**Too slow and you'll miss it, too careless and you'll end up serving mystery soup to very confused customers.**\n\n{943074245395273}\n\nTrain your eye. Trust your blade. Master every recipe one clean slice at a time.\n\nFast hands. Sharp blade. Hungry panda.\n\nBecome the Ramen Master. \ud83d\udc3c", "short_description": "A panda chef. A flying ingredient. One clean slice.\nRun the most chaotic ramen shop in Asia. Cut the right ingredients mid-air to craft the perfect recipe, or serve your customers a bowl of pure regret.\nHow sharp is your blade?"}]}, "developer_name": "A